  "_steps_about": "Every command step: the gates run.py start checks (looked up here — nowhere else), what it must produce before run.py finish will close it, and (reads) the only files the agent reads for that step (run.py start prints them). {batch} and {page} come from --batch / --page; {prev_post} is the newest blog post. produces: an artifact name (a status.py mark recorded during the run), 'steps:S01,S02' (an outcome for each audit step), 'batch:{batch}:<stage>' (the batch files recorded), 'blog_post' (a new post registered with its file), 'batch_state:{batch}:a|b' (the batch reached one of those states). 'marked:<artifact>' as a gate = that artifact is recorded (status.py mark). In produces, 'a|b' = either artifact recorded by this run.",
  "artifacts": {
    "entity_record": "the Decision Sheet and the Discovery Record with the entity foundation (Brand Guide A/B proposal)",
    "proof_sheet": "the client proof sheet (.md; the Google Doc client copy is separate) — or the client's direct answers",
    "proof_sheet_returned": "the client's returned proof sheet, saved as given",
    "audit_deliverables": "the Finding Register, URL Decision Map, Recommendations and Evidence Manifest",
    "reconciled": "the reconciled Brand Guide (clients/<slug>/brand-guide.md)",
    "blocker_checklist": "the Technical Blocker Checklist",
    "site_plan": "the site plan (.md, registered with status.py plan)",
    "link_wheel": "the Link Wheel Tables and the wheel verification",
    "schema_built": "the validated schema files",
    "release_qa": "the QA Punch-List and acceptance sheets",
    "blog_map": "the Blog Decision Map",
    "topics": "the Blog Topic List",
    "wordpress_pilot": "the WordPress pilot report (/wp-check --pilot)",
    "story_round": "the stories interview round (questions for the owner)",
    "story_bank": "the updated story bank (clients/<slug>/interviews/story-bank.md)",
    "voice_dna": "the author's Voice DNA file (clients/<slug>/interviews/voice-dna-<author>.md)",
    "facts_direct": "the client's answers given directly (no sheet sent), saved verbatim as MANUAL evidence"
  },
